	(text "M.2 NVMe SOLID-STATE STORAGE (PCIe Gen 2.0 x1)\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n• Interface: Single PCIe 2.0 Lane (5.0 Gbps / 500 MB/s max)\n• Socket: Standard M.2 Key-M (TE 2199119-4 / 2199230)\n• Supported Card Lengths: M.2 2242 (42mm) and 2280 (80mm)\n• AC Coupling: 100 nF 0402 ceramic capacitors on TX pair\n• PEDET: Pulled to GND to signal NVMe/PCIe mode to SSD\n• Activity: Green LED pulses on read/write disk activity"
		(at 50.0 168.0 0)
